:: Dad Hang Out End Late High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
As the sun creeps lower and lower and the various streetlights come on, you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> sit down for a moment to catch your breath, well, mainly so <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Dad</span> can. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Phew! It gets harder to keep up with you kids every year!”</span> He laughs. The two of you talk for a minute before a ping from <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Dad</span>’s phone pulls his attention. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“One second, just need to answer a question for someone.”</span> As <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> types away on his phone, you start to feel more than a little sleepy. <span style="color:LightGreen">Seems the day’s fun and the gently coolness of the sun going down has caused your tiredness to kick in.</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Dad",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Eyes: "Tired",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

Your eyes feel heavy, your limbs tired, and the thing you want most in the world becomes a nap. It’s only been a minute of sitting, but your head has already begun to sway back and forth and you find it harder and harder to stay awake. Falling asleep in public is never a good idea, <span style="color:Pink">but with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> by your side, you feel safe. Even asleep and defenseless, you know you’ll be protected with him around.</span> <br>
<br>


<div id="choice">
	<<link "Let yourself fall asleep<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        So, you give into your exhaustion and lean against <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>, gently closing your eyes. You feel him turn, a brief pause, <span style="color:LightGreen">then a warm hand rubs your head. It feels nice.</span> You find your body slipping down, your head resting upon <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>’s lap now. <span style="color:LightGreen">You open your eyes just enough to see him smiling down at you before you let sleep take you.</span> <br>
        <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Dad",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Eyes: "Closed",
                Blush: 1,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        You dream of yourself as a baby, or around that age. You had just been given a bath that was a tad too cold and now, dressed only in your nightwear, you stir about uncomfortable and cold. Then, a man comes over and picks you up. You know who the man is, despite his face being blurry. He takes you in his big, warm arms and lies down next to you. <span style="color:LightGreen">Your body becomes soothed and the chill is replaced with a comforting warmth. You want this moment to last forever.</span> <br>
        <br>
        You wake up an unknown amount of time later in your bed. You sit up, rubbing your eyes and glancing around. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> must have carried you home. <span style="color:LightGreen">You blush a little at the idea of being seen, passed out and carried by <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> like a baby, but also can’t help but smile. You make a mental note to thank him later.</span> <br>
        <br>
