    <</link>>
	<<link "Fight to stay awake<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        Despite the tiredness growing stronger and stronger with every second, you fight your body to stay awake. Your head sways and tries to fall, but you keep it up and tap your finger on the seat to ensure your body stays awake. It is a battle, but you manage to last until <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> stands up and yawns. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Welp, we better get home. The other two are probably wondering about dinner. Not sure which would be crankier if they didn’t get fed.”</span> He laughs as you give your opinion, the conversation causing the sleepiness to dissipate. <span style="color:LightGreen">The two of you begin to walk and talk, heading home while having fun, even if meaningless, conversations about your day, your brothers, and what you want to eat for dinner. It is a nice, wholesome moment.</span> <br>
